{
 "source": "MetricsTest llmOptimisationGaugesReflectLatestSnapshot and clearDropsLlmOptimisationSnapshot over the wire: building the optimisation report (GET /mockserver/llm/optimisationReport) publishes its verdict's saving, cache-hit ratio and one-shot rate as the three mock_server_llm_* gauges; what a reset does to them",
